text:
The successor rules lock two blocks, Cara–Hana and Ivo–Finn–Gus, with Cara before Ivo. Ann sits exactly two slots from Cara, and Dev must sit before Cara and at least three slots from Ivo. The only placement that leaves legal slots for Ben and Elif is Cara in 2 (Ann in 4) and Ivo–Finn–Gus in 6–8.

